  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LightShadow.Core.LocalizedText
  english: 'The gate closes behind her. The sky above the school turns from black
    to grey to a thin, clean gold.


    She opens the memory box on the pavement
    and reads her mother''s lesson plans one last time.'
